 "schema": "per-clvl allocation, same shape as build-paladin-normal30.json (leveler.ParseBuild). main_attack: extra, for combat: skill to use as main attack per clvl range, weapon says which equipped weapon type it needs ('any' = none). Quest points (Den, Radament, Izual) are folded into the row where the guide spends them; the planner pulls rows forward when more points are unspent than the level grants.",
 "tags": "Skills: V Maxroll for Fire Arrow (2-5 and Den/Izual points), Multiple Shot 11 and Exploding Arrow 12+ (https://maxroll.gg/d2/guides/amazon-leveling-guide, fetched 2026-10-29). U adaptation: Maxroll spends 6-10 on Poison Javelin and swaps weapons; the bot has no weapon swap, so those points go to Fire Arrow (a bow skill). Magic Arrow 1 point at clvl 2 (Maxroll takes it from the Den of Evil quest point; it is the Multiple Shot prerequisite, V skills.txt). Quest points are not separate rows: the planner pulls rows forward. Stats V Maxroll: 2-11 Vit; 12: 3 Dex 2 Str; 13 Str; 14-16 Energy; 17+ Vit (30: U continues Vit). Hunter's Bow needs 28 Dex (V weapons.txt), start Dex 25: the clvl 12 +3 Dex is when it becomes wearable; before that a Short Bow (15 Dex). Start gear is a Javelin + Buckler (V charstats.txt, V live smoke-amazon): buy bow + Arrows at Charsi first (docs/gear.md). Prerequisites and reqlevels checked against skills.txt (V Patch_D2.mpq). BUILDV2 (SME, fresh Amazons; edited in place, the table only moves Multiple Shot from clvl 11 to 7 and its Fire Arrow point to 11, no owned skill is refunded so a running Amazon just continues): clvl 2 Magic Arrow 1, 3-6 Fire Arrow, 7 Multiple Shot 1 (req_level 6, needs Magic Arrow, V skills.txt via internal/gear/data.json), 8-11 Fire Arrow, 12 Exploding Arrow (needs Fire Arrow and Multiple Shot). The bow line stays the default; amazon_javelin_normal30 is the non-default variant.",
